A block glued to a split combined token or a forced span's own delimiter

```
b *//*{c_}*/
.
<p>b <strong c_="">//</strong>*/</p>
```

```
//*a*{c_}*/
.
<p>//<strong c_="">a</strong>*/</p>
```

```
b *///*{t="*/"}
.
<p>b <strong t="*/">///</strong></p>
```

```
{*x *b*{t=a*}
.
<p><strong>x *b*{t=a</strong></p>
```

```
{_x _b_{t=a_}
.
<p><u>x _b_{t=a</u></p>
```
